div.p:
In accordance with your request, reports have been submitted to you on this incident by Acting Secretary of State Irwin (Tab B) and Secretary of Transportation Volpe (Tab C). Both reports agree generally (but diverge on specifics) that the investigations revealed the following two problems were immediately involved in this case:
—the Coast Guard unit involved was not adequately informed of the standing instructions and procedures for dealing with potential defectors;
—there was inadequate communication between the State Department and the Coast Guard.
